'''Benevolent Souma''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.6 Update|Version 8.6]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]] grants target [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] and increases its chance to [[Slow]] and [[Weaken]] to 100%. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

